output.sparql:
PREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>
PREFIX wd: <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/>
SELECT ?author WHERE {
  wd:Q190192 wdt:P50 ?author .
}

content.message:
The search results show that the correct property for the author of a literary work is **P50: author**. This property is specifically defined as "main creator(s) of a written work (use on works, not humans)".

So, I will now query the Dune book (wd:Q190192) and retrieve its author using property P50.

Query:
```sparql
SELECT ?author ?label WHERE {
  wd:Q190192 wdt:P50 ?author .
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language \"[AUTO_LANGUAGE],en\". }
}
```

I will execute this query to get the author of the Dune book.
